  "steps": [
   "Heat the oil in a large casserole over a medium heat. Add the onion and carrots with a pinch of the salt and cook for 10 minutes, stirring now and then, until soft.",
   "Stir in the garlic, smoked paprika and cumin and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
   "Add the split peas, tomatoes, stock and bay. Bring to the boil, then cover and simmer for 25 minutes. Peel and chop the parsnips while it cooks.",
   "Stir in the parsnips and simmer, covered, for 20 to 25 minutes more, until the split peas are soft and the parsnips tender. Add a splash of water if it gets too thick.",
   "Lay the broccoli on top, cover and cook for 5 to 6 minutes until just tender. Squeeze in the lemon, then season with the rest of the salt and plenty of pepper."
